        <briefdescription>
<para>VTM-specific thermal trip trigger types. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Three independent temperature trip thresholds, each triggering an interrupt when the die temperature crosses the configured boundary. Configure thresholds via <ref refid="group__sensor__interface_1gafbf65226a227e9f8824908bc38e336f5" kindref="member">sensor_attr_set()</ref> with <ref refid="group__ti__vtm__sensor__interface_1ga52fc6f83f2fdaab8550fbdf449291778" kindref="member">vtm_sensor_attribute</ref>, then register handlers via <ref refid="group__sensor__interface_1ga7c72aca732e0641612d2f9437c2e41b7" kindref="member">sensor_trigger_set()</ref>. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
